{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_36","type":"agent_message","text":"One issue emerged from the first draft: the environment’s actual grid can vary, so the controller must price multi-step moves exactly. I’m patching the cost accounting and enabling high-beta repair even from a single late root preview, otherwise the new mechanism would never fire on a pure single-root episode."}}
