{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_38","type":"agent_message","text":"The schedule now prices real step counts and can spend a late high-beta repair even when there’s only one main trajectory, which is essential for this single-root family. I’m running syntax checks and then a tiny fake-env dry run to verify monotone target use and that beta 1.0 cannot exceed 64."}}
